            "review_title": "Review at Bistro NIQ - Phan Kế Bính",
            "review_text": "Liz\nHanoi, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nTasty Food and a Nice Casual Spot\nSep 2026 • Friends\nThe location is convenient and easy to find. I had a nice meal at Bistro NIQ. Tried the beef sushi and chicken karaage with tartar sauce, both were really tasty and well prepared. The karaage was crispy and went really well with the tartar sauce. Service was fine and the overall experience was pleasant. Overall, a solid spot for a casual meal. Reasonable for the quality of the food. Would come back to try more dishes. No wait time.\nRead more\nWritten October 11, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
